From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:20:38 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 011/207] deepseek: bound index scratch before planning and
 pricing

Adapt JustLateNightAI / Astra's PR #78 to the current symbolic planner. Bound live index scratch for regular, K4 and both TBO branches before workspace reuse and pricing. Preserve the failing baseline extent receipt and test ragged shapes and the materialized TBO counterexample without changing arithmetic.
---
